  <item>
    <title>07.跨越2024，启航2025</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6796f2de247d51713c8074f3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6796f2de247d51713c8074f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Jan 2025 02:56:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>再过两天就到了真正的2025，总有不舍，总有遗憾，但我们一直在路上</span></p><span></span><p><span>新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpagX_65hOwyQRUVlckXuBmwTNBg.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpP9QDJtZuqFRTD1Saa59LeYvg3K.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a>:职业规划与情绪管理：在工作中面临的挑战与应对策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">00:04:15</a>:目标达成的喜悦与工作挑战的平衡：2025年的时间沟通与实践挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">00:07:04</a>:情绪的接纳与控制：如何处理一级和二级情绪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">00:10:38</a>:接纳情绪，处理关系：一本书中的实用建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">00:14:10</a>:进入心流的美妙体验：马拉松与冥想的相似之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">00:17:43</a>:坚持跑步，探索内心深处：冥想与旅游的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">00:21:17</a>:内心的力量源泉：探索觉知力和心灵触动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">00:24:49</a>:跳脱出社会功利，探寻语言交流的灵活性——工作坊中的启示与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">00:28:24</a>:如何引导成年人实现语言学习目标？挑战与方法探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">00:31:55</a>:目标与期待：2025年我想要实现的事项和期望的情绪清晰度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">00:35:28</a>:互相支持的力量：探索贵人朋友的新定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">00:39:00</a>:亲密关系的更新定义：重新建立联系，不离不弃的友谊</span></p>]]></description>
